Route34_DayCare_Text_YourMonHasGrownXLevels:
	.string "按等级算，你的{STR_VAR_1}\n提升了{STR_VAR_2}。$"
	.string ""

Route34_DayCare_Text_YourTeamIsFull:
	.string "你的宝可梦队伍满了。\n腾出位置再来找我吧。$"
	.string ""

